  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Since, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>tan</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math>and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>cot</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mi>x</mi></math> exists for all <math><mi>x</mi><mo>∈</mo><mi>&nbsp;</mi></math>R and <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>cos</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math>&nbsp;exist if&nbsp;<math><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>1</mn></math><br /><br />&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>⇒</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>≤</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>3</mn></math><br /><br />Thus, the domain of the given function is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>]</mo></math>."
  }
